OL,3,GNEWSA'Cruel abuser enjoyed' terrorising
OL,4,Apartner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "cruel" domestic abuser who got
OL,7,F"enjoyment" out of terrorising his
OL,8,Fpartner has been jailed for two and a
OL,9,Fhalf years.
OL,11,FDaniel Kane's campaign of violence and
OL,12,F"psychological manipulation" against
OL,13,Fthe woman included headbutting her,
OL,14,Fabandoning her at a service station and
OL,15,Fdestroying her phone in a microwave,
OL,16,FNewcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,18,FThe woman said she had felt "powerless"
OL,19,Fand in constant fear of what Kane would
OL,20,Fdo next during the almost two-year long
OL,21,Frelationship.
