OL,6,FKane, 47, and from Woolsington,
OL,7,FNewcastle, admitted offences including
OL,8,Fcoercive and controlling behaviour,
OL,9,Fwith his barrister saying he was
OL,10,F"riddled" with an alcohol addiction at
OL,11,Fthe time.
